    Hybrid fan-out. 
    On Write: Publish post -> fan-out workers to follower timelines (Redis sorted sets) for regular users. Skip clebrities.
    On Read: fetch pre-computed timeline from cache + pull recent clebrity posts + merge + rank + return top 50. Use Kafka to decouple write from fan-out.

